  "releaseNotes": "PDChat Voice Mode: the mode picker now shows what the microphone is doing. After Mic off, the voice button resumed listening while the picker still read Mic off; it now shows the running mode while listening, and Mic off only while the microphone is off. While the microphone is off, the voice button keeps its mode icon and carries a small badge, PDChatIcons.MicOff, a microphone with a slash by default; an empty value shows no badge. PDChat gains VoiceModeShortcutKey, a KeyboardEvent.code such as KeyM, null by default so nothing changes for existing hosts. When set, Alt with that key, while focus is in the chat, cycles the picker through Mic off, HAL, Dictate and the wake phrase mode when offered, and the picker's tooltip names it. Ctrl with Alt (AltGr) does not trigger it, read aloud is left as it was, and it does nothing while the chat is minimised.",
